From: Rasheed <99349713+gitRasheed@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 00:09:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 48/61] docs: NNS.reg man page matches the implementation

Roxygen (R/Regression.R) and man/NNS.reg.Rd:
- n.best default is floor((1 - NNS.copula(cbind(x, y))) * sqrt(nrow(x))),
  not sqrt(# of regressors) (.nns_mreg_default_nbest).
- dim.red.method = "cor" uses Spearman correlation.
- confidence.interval: global type-8 residual quantiles added to
  Fitted.xy as conf.int.pos/neg; no per-segment standard errors.
- multivariate Fitted.xy has no gradient column (verified names: V1 V2
  y y.hat NNS.ID residuals).
- type: auto-classification triggers for exactly {0, 1} numeric,
  factor, character or logical responses; type = "XONLY" has no effect
  (identical Fitted.xy with and without it), so its example is removed.
- equation denominator counts abs(coefficient) > 0.
Documentation only.
---
 R/Regression.R | 16 +++++++---------
 man/NNS.reg.Rd | 16 +++++++---------
 2 files changed, 14 insertions(+), 18 deletions(-)

